# Review comment preferences

Optional consumer-owned writing notes. Save an edited copy as `voice/STYLE.md` under the
configured inbox home. Leave sections empty until the reviewer supplies preferences or
accepts an observation from their own actual posted comments.

## Accepted preferences

For each preference, record its scope and supporting sample filename, or identify it as an
explicit request from the reviewer. A preference may apply only to one repository or kind
of comment. Do not turn an isolated correction into a universal rule.

## Examples to consult

List only authorized local samples useful for the current writing task. Distinguish actual
posted text from drafts. Avoid copying another person's corpus or confidential text into
this file or into a public package.

## Open questions

Record conflicting examples or choices needing the reviewer's judgment. When evidence is
insufficient, a plain factual comment is preferable to inventing a personal writing style.
